  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): セイヨウコウホネ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BB%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A8%E3%82%A6%E3%82%B3%E3%82%A6%E3%83%9B%E3%83%8D",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 110660732,
      "text": "セイヨウコウホネ は、スイレン科コウホネ属に属する水草の1種である。葉を水中と水面につけ（沈水葉と浮水葉）、浮水葉は長さ16–30センチメートル (cm)、葉柄の断面は三角形。花は黄色、カップ状で直径 3–6.5 cm、柱頭盤は円形（図1）。ヨーロッパからシベリア、西アジアなどに広く分布している。学名のうち、種小名の lutea はラテン語で「黄色」を意味し、花の色を示している。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Nuphar lutea",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuphar_lutea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1361575435,
      "text": "Nuphar lutea, the yellow water-lily, is an aquatic plant of the family Nymphaeaceae, native to northern temperate and some subtropical regions of Europe, northwest Africa, and western Asia. This species was used as a food source and in medicinal practices from prehistoric times with potential research and medical applications going forward."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Nuphar lutea",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuphar_lutea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171715471,
      "text": "El nenúfar amarillo es una especie de planta acuática de la familia de las ninfáceas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Nuphar lutea",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuphar_lutea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 238550814,
      "text": "Nuphar lutea, aussi appelé en français Nénuphar jaune, Nénufar jaune ou Nuphar commun, et parfois aillout d'eau ou plateau, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Nymphaeaceae. C'est l'espèce la plus commune du genre Nuphar en Europe de l'Ouest et l'une des espèces nord-américaines. C'est une plante herbacée aquatique."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Nuphar lutea",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuphar_lutea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 55525574,
      "text": "Nuphar lutea é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Nymphaeaceae."
    }
  },
